---
description: Keep Hub form controls visually consistent across feature panels
globs: packages/web/src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Shared Hub Form Controls

- New feature panels must use `FormField`, `TextControl`, `TextAreaControl`, and
  `SelectControl` from `components/ui/FormField.tsx`.
- Do not rely on another feature's scoped selector such as
  `.evidence-form input` to style a new control.
- Add feature-local CSS only for layout or deliberate visual variants; shared
  border, spacing, typography, focus, and disabled states belong to
  `.form-control` and `.form-field`.
- Verify controls in the narrow catalog rail, including long option text,
  disabled state, and all lifecycle states rendered after submission.
